# What `vercel deploy` never uploads (ADR 0031). The deploy job runs it from the repo
# root, and the Vercel project's Root Directory is backend/: only the API goes live.
# Secrets first: they live in Vercel's settings, never in an upload.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

/mobile
/docs
/.github
/backend/tests
/backend/scripts
/backend/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
